The '''Nightsisters' altar''', or '''Nightsister Spirit Altar''', was an altar located in the [[Nightsister lair]] on [[Dathomir]].

==History==
When the [[Nightsisters|Nightsister]] [[Asajj Ventress]] returned to [[Dathomir]], her body was placed on the altar while [[Mother (title)|Mother]] [[Talzin]] directed the Nightsisters to gather basins containing the [[Water of Life]]. The coven then encircled Ventress with the Waters while Talzin led them in a shamanistic ritual intended to heal the [[assassin]]. During the ceremony, the dark magicks caused Ventress to experience vivid and painful visions of her past—her transfer to [[Hal'Sted]] and his eventual murder, her [[Jedi training|training]] under [[Ky Narec]] and his eventual murder, and ultimately her tutelage under [[Dooku]] and his attempted murder of Ventress herself.<ref name="Nightsisters">{{TCW|Nightsisters (episode)}}</ref>

